Project Overview: 

Land: 
Isometric vie wf regualr tiles

Each tile has its own properties and can be in one of three states:
- On fire
- Burnt (regrows after a certain timestep and neighbouring conditions)
- Not on fire

Each tile has assocated properties that affect its behaviour as well as an associated height. 

Land can be of the default 4 types:
- grass 
- forest 
- sand 
- rocky
- water
The type affects if it can sbe set on fire and how 

Fire: 

Fire can spread to neighbouring tiles with a certain porbability depdending in a few factors: 
- wind(affects tiles directionally)
- fuel (whats on the tiles)
- Slope (fire spreads easier up a slope)





